# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# StudyFlow AI — CLIENT environment template
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle.
# NEVER put secrets here — anything bundled into the client is PUBLIC.
#
# Deployment model: SAME-ORIGIN (Option A).
#   • Development: `npm run dev` runs Vite on :3000 and proxies /api/* to the
#     Express server on :5000 (see vite.config.js).
#   • Production: `npm run build` emits client/dist, which Express serves on the
#     same origin as the API. The app calls the API via relative /api/* paths.
#
# => The client requires NO environment variables in this model. There is no
#    VITE_API_BASE_URL because the API is always same-origin.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
